n: run 36156255216\n- reviewed evidence assembly: run 36156781963\n\nThe mandatory exact-source validation/build, bounded static/production checks, frozen artifact hash chain, and offline inventory checks passed. Automated full suites and extended device/browser matrices remain temporarily waived and were not passed. Public GitHub Pages selection, deployed-byte audit, and bounded browser acceptance are separate and not yet claimed by this draft."}